### 8. Insecure Default Configuration ⚠️ LOW
**Issue:** Running on default port 3000 without any environment configuration.

**Risk:** Easier discovery, potential runs on unexpected ports.

**Recommendation:**
```javascript
// Environment-based configuration
const PORT = process.env.PORT || process.env.PORT_DEFAULT || 3000;
const HOST = process.env.HOST || '0.0.0.0';
const NODE_ENV = process.env.NODE_ENV || 'development';

app.listen(PORT, HOST, () => {
  console.log(`Server running on ${HOST}:${PORT} in ${NODE_ENV} mode`);
});
